          "architecture_note": "We hold no explicit recipient timezone and no verified address, and area-code inference is forbidden as the legal local-time fact (counsel 26a-1). With no rung of the evidence ladder available, the conservative fallback is refusal - the gate cannot show a send is inside the window, so it does not send.",
