      "applicability": "A commercial electronic message under CASL: sent to an electronic address, and one it would be reasonable to conclude has as its purpose encouraging participation in a commercial activity. A booking confirmation for a paid inspection is a CEM that falls inside the 6(6)(b) exception, not a message outside CASL.",
