          "note": "6(6) opens 'Paragraph (1)(a) does not apply to a commercial electronic message that SOLELY' - so the consent limb is excused, the 6(1)(b) content limb is not, and the exception is lost the moment the message does anything beyond the listed purpose. A confirmation carrying a review link is no longer solely (b).",
